            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">3. Protection functions</h2>
            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">4. Application</h2>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">REF601/REJ601 offers three-stage overcurrent and two-stage earth-fault protection functions.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The transformer inrush detector function is incorporated to prevent unwanted tripping's due to energizing of transformers.</p>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The low-set stages for overcurrent and earth-fault protection are equipped with selectable characteristics - Definite time (DT) and Inverse definite minimum time (IDMT). The relay features standard IDMT characteristics according IEC 61</p>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Further relay offers thermal overload protection for feeder, cable and transformer, negative phase sequence protection, phase discontinuity protection and circuit breaker failure protection. Relay also has feature of auto-reclose function for overhead line feeders.</p>

