            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">13. Local HMI</h2>
            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">14. Inputs and outputs</h2>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Local HMI of relay contains LCD display, LED indicators and navigation keys. The user can view the measured values, recorded data, events, setting values and configuration parameters. The relay has six LED indicators on LHMl which are configured for status, trip, fault, protection trip, phase fault trip, earth fault trip and trip circuit supervision.</p>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The relay is equipped with four phase current and one earth current inputs. The phase-current inputs are configurable for 1/5A or 5A, and the earth current inputs are configurable for 1/5A or 5A secondary current transformers.</p>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The relay has four binary inputs. The inputs can be configured for various functions like Blocking, Protection reset, Breaker position, Breaker control and trip circuit supervision. In addition, the inputs can be mapped at binary output and LEDs for indications. Individual input can be configured either as "Inverted" or "Non Inverted".</p>

