        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">15. Communication</h2>
            <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">16. Application warning</h2>
        </div>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">The relay is available with optional communication features, REF601/REJ601 can be connected to a SCADA system via MODBUS RTU protocol on RS-485 bus with two wire connection. This allows the relay to be monitored and controlled by the SCADA system through serial communication.</p>

        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">In case the relay REF601 is supplied with UPS step-up or square-wave, an in-between transformer is needed to keep the supply voltage stable.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 11pt;">These are the recommended transformer characteristics:</p>
        <ul>
